  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "63",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 63"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "63",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngubani lo ovela kwa-Edomi, nezingubo ezidayiwe zaseBozira na? lowo okhazimulayo engutsheni yakhe uhamba ebukhulu bamandla akhe? Mina engikhuluma ngokulunga nginamandla okusindisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungani ubomvu engutsheni yakho, nezingubo zakho zinjengezonyathela amanoni ewayini?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mina ngedwa nginyathele isikhamo sewayini; phakathi kwabantu kwakungekho nami, ngokuba ngiyakubanyathela ngentukuthelo yami, ngibanyathele ngokufutheka kwami; igazi labo liyofafazwa ezingutsheni zami, ngingcolise zonke izingubo zami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngokuba usuku lwempindiselo lusenhliziyweni yami, nomnyaka wokuhlengwa kwami usufikile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngabheka, kepha kwakungekho osizayo; futhi ngamangala ukuthi kwakungekho muntu owayengasekela; ngalokho ingalo yami yangilethela insindiso; futhi ukudabuka kwami, kwangisekela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakunyathela abantu ngolaka lwami, ngibadakise ngokufutheka kwami, ngiwise amandla abo emhlabathini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngithanda ukukhuluma ngomusa kaJehova nodumo lukaJehova njengakho konke uJehova asenzele khona, nokulunga okukhulu kuyo indlu ka-Israyeli abenzele yona ngokobubele bakhe nangobuningi bezizwe ezingcwele umusa wakhe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba wathi: Isibili bangabantu bami, abantwana abangaqambi amanga; ngakho waba nguMsindisi wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukho konke ukuhlupheka kwabo wacindezelwa, ingilosi yobuso bakhe yabakhulula; othandweni lwakhe nangobubele bakhe wabahlenga; wazithwala, wazithwala zonke izinsuku zasendulo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha bahlubuka, bahlupha uMoya wakhe oNgcwele; ngalokho waba yisitha sabo walwa nabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayesecabanga ngezinsuku zasendulo, uMose nabantu bakhe, wathi: “Uphi yena owabakhuphula elwandle kanye nomalusi womhlambi wakhe na?” uphi yena owafaka umoya wakhe ongcwele kuye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owabahola ngesandla sokunene sikaMose ngengalo yakhe ekhazimulayo, wababela amanzi phambi kwabo ukuba amenzele igama eliphakade na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owabahola ekujuleni, njengehhashi ehlane, ukuba bangakhubeki na?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njengesilwane sehlela esigodini, uMoya kaJehova wamphumuza; kanjalo wabahola abantu bakho ukuba uzenzele igama elitusekayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bheka usezulwini, ubone usendaweni yakho engcwele neyenkazimulo yakho: iphi ukushisekela kwakho namandla akho, nomsindo wezibilini zakho nomusa wakho kimi na? babeboshiwe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isibili wena ungubaba wethu, lanxa uAbrahama engasazi, loIsrayeli engasazi; Wena Jehova ungubaba, ungumsindisi wethu; igama lakho likhona kwaphakade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O Jehova, usidukiseleni ezindleleni zakho, wenze lukhuni izinhliziyo zethu ekukwesabeni na? Buya ngenxa yezinceku zakho, izizwe zefa lakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.63.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.63.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 63:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
